WEBVTT

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.239
And you know, there's a new version
of Windows coming out this fall.

00:09:03.263 --> 00:09:06.318
If they continue at this pace,
there's absolutely no telling

00:09:06.342 --> 00:09:08.488
where they might wind up.

00:09:08.512 --> 00:09:10.850
[Welcome to the Type a Word Wizard]

00:09:10.874 --> 00:09:12.042
(Laughter)

00:09:12.066 --> 00:09:15.356
(Applause)

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:17.165
"Welcome to the Type a Word Wizard."

00:09:17.189 --> 00:09:18.404
Ok, I'll bite.

00:09:18.428 --> 00:09:20.976
Let's click "Next" to continue.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:23.303
(Laughter)

00:09:23.327 --> 00:09:25.174
(Applause)

00:09:25.198 --> 00:09:28.548
From the drop-down menu, choose
the first letter you want to type. Ok.

00:09:28.572 --> 00:09:30.905
(Laughter)